  "html": "<!--$--><section class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-plum to-rose text-white\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-14 md:py-20\"><div><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"mb-6\"><ol class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/75\"><li><a class=\"hover:text-white\" href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3 w-3\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white\" href=\"/therapy-services\">Therapy Services</a></li><li aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3 w-3\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></li><li class=\"text-white\" aria-current=\"page\">Bullying</li></ol></nav><p class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/85 mb-3\">Children &amp; Adolescent Therapy</p><h1 class=\"text-white text-[32px] md:text-[44px] font-semibold leading-[1.08] max-w-3xl\">Bullying</h1><div class=\"h-[3px] w-16 bg-sun my-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center min-h-12 px-7 rounded whitespace-nowrap text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] transition-colors duration-300 bg-white text-plum hover:bg-blush \" href=\"/contact\">Contact Us</a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center min-h-12 px-7 rounded whitespace-nowrap text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] transition-colors duration-300 border border-white/70 text-white hover:bg-white/10 \" href=\"/practitioners\">See Practitioners</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-white \"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-14 md:py-20 \"><div class=\"mb-10 max-w-3xl\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold\">Bullying</h2><div class=\"h-[3px] w-14 bg-sun mt-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"max-w-3xl text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-ink/90 mb-5\">Bullying can severely harm a child or adolescent’s self-esteem and disrupt their identity development during adolescence.</p><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3\">Early detection of bullying is vital!</h3><p class=\"max-w-3xl text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-ink/90 mb-5\">Bullying is an aggressive behaviour where the victim feels powerless and vulnerable. It’s often about a bully using aggression and control to assert power. The behaviour is demeaning and disrespectful, and over time, it intensifies the power imbalance, leaving the victim feeling hurt and defenceless. Bullying can take many forms, including physical, psychological, verbal, social exclusion, and more.</p><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3\">How to recognise if your child is being bullied</h3><ul class=\"max-w-3xl space-y-2.5 my-6\"><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-ink/90\"><span class=\"mt-[10px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-rose\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>Your child becomes quieter, more withdrawn, and keeps to themselves.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-ink/90\"><span class=\"mt-[10px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-rose\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>They show increased anger or aggression.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-ink/90\"><span class=\"mt-[10px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-rose\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>They become more sensitive to things that don’t bother them.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-ink/90\"><span class=\"mt-[10px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-rose\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>They lose interest in activities they once enjoyed.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-ink/90\"><span class=\"mt-[10px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-rose\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>They complain of physical ailments like stomach aches or headaches.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-ink/90\"><span class=\"mt-[10px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-rose\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>They lose interest in playing with friends, doing homework, or attending school.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-ink/90\"><span class=\"mt-[10px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-rose\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>They have a decreased appetite.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-ink/90\"><span class=\"mt-[10px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-rose\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>They experience nightmares, bed-wetting, or poor sleep.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-ink/90\"><span class=\"mt-[10px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-rose\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>They refuse to go to school.</span></li></ul><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3\">Ten tips to help your child deal with bullying</h3><ul class=\"max-w-3xl space-y-2.5 my-6\"><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-ink/90\"><span class=\"mt-[10px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-rose\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>Educate your children about bullying and how to recognise it.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-ink/90\"><span class=\"mt-[10px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-rose\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>Encourage open communication. Let them talk about both the good and evil in their lives.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-ink/90\"><span class=\"mt-[10px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-rose\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>Assure them that bullying is not their fault, and that seeking help is essential.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-ink/90\"><span class=\"mt-[10px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-rose\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>Emphasize that bullying is unacceptable and not a normal part of growing up.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-ink/90\"><span class=\"mt-[10px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-rose\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>Explain that bullying worsens over time, so early intervention is crucial.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-ink/90\"><span class=\"mt-[10px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-rose\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>Address bullies directly, not through social media.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-ink/90\"><span class=\"mt-[10px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-rose\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>Teach your child to be assertive. Role-play how to stand up to bullies.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-ink/90\"><span class=\"mt-[10px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-rose\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>Help your child identify supportive friends and practice seeking their help.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-ink/90\"><span class=\"mt-[10px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-rose\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>Monitor their use of computers and media. Keep computers in public areas and limit mobile phone use at night.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-ink/90\"><span class=\"mt-[10px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-rose\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>Be a good role model in communication and problem-solving at home.</span></li></ul><p class=\"max-w-3xl text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-ink/90 mb-5\">Taking these steps can empower your child to face and overcome bullying.</p></div></section><div data-mbp=\"related\"></div><section class=\"bg-blush\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl px-5 py-14 md:py-16 text-center\"><p class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-rose mb-2.5\">Take the first step</p><h2 class=\"text-[30px] md:text-[40px] font-semibold leading-[1.1]\">Ready to Take the First Step?</h2><div class=\"h-[3px] w-14 bg-sun mt-4 mx-auto\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"mt-5 text-[17px]\">Seeking support can feel overwhelming, but you do not have to navigate life&#x27;s challenges alone. Our administration team can help answer your questions, explain appointment options and connect you with a suitable practitioner.</p><p class=\"mt-3\">Prefer to call? Phone our administration team on <a class=\"text-ocean underline underline-offset-4 font-medium\" href=\"tel:0731850040\">07 3185 0040</a>.</p><div class=\"mt-7 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center min-h-12 px-7 rounded whitespace-nowrap text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] transition-colors duration-300 bg-rose text-white hover:bg-[#9d2a59] \" href=\"/practitioners\">Book Online</a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center min-h-12 px-7 rounded whitespace-nowrap text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] transition-colors duration-300 bg-ocean text-white hover:bg-[#095a6f] \" href=\"/contact\">Contact Us</a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center min-h-12 px-7 rounded whitespace-nowrap text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] transition-colors duration-300 border border-plum text-plum hover:bg-lilac  active\" href=\"/therapy-services\" data-status=\"active\" aria-current=\"page\">Explore Services</a></div><p class=\"mt-5 text-sm text-ink/70\">If in crisis, please call 000.</p></div></section><!--/$-->"
